     "title": "Beat The Champions – Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "⚽ Gameplay & AI Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Major AI adjustments have been made to deliver more challenging and realistic matches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved player positioning on the field.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased offensive aggression from the CPU.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Expanded the variety of plays and decision-making available during matches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎮 New Difficulty Levels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a new Very Hard difficulty mode for players looking for the ultimate challenge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Introduced Dynamic Difficulty, which adjusts the challenge level based on your performance throughout the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "⭐ Updated Team & Player Ratings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebalanced the overall ratings of all national teams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players now have individual ratings, creating more meaningful differences between footballers and teams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🥅 Penalty Shootout Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Goalkeeper behavior has been refined to make penalty shootouts more balanced and exciting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Saving penalties is now more achievable, leading to more dramatic shootout moments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔊 New Audio Options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added volume controls for a more customizable experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now adjust the commentator volume independently from the rest of the game's audio.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "📚 User Experience Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tutorial is no longer mandatory when launching the game for the first time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
